OL,3,GNEWSAWoman found in alleyway with
OL,4,A'life-changing' injuries
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman in her sixties was found in an
OL,7,Falleyway underneath a bridge with
OL,8,Finjuries believed to be potentially
OL,9,Flife-changing, police say.
OL,11,FDorset Police said it was reported that
OL,12,Fthe woman had been found with injuries
OL,13,Fshortly after 10:00 GMT on Thursday in
OL,14,Fan alleyway that runs between Sawmills
OL,15,FLane and Herringston Road in
OL,16,FDorchester.
OL,18,FThe woman, who was taken to hospital
OL,19,Ffor treatment, is described as wearing
OL,20,Fa white bucket hat, dark-coloured coat,
OL,21,Fdark-coloured trousers and white shoes.
